## The problem

AI assistants forget everything between sessions. Each new chat re-learns brand rules, CRM conventions and report formats, and does it slightly differently each time.

## What I built

A library of skill files that encode the rules once (brand voice, CRM operations, report style, design system). Agents load them on demand, so the output stays consistent across sessions and tools.

